  "markdown": "Material family\n\n# Contract vinyl\n\nA tighter face specified for wear. At The OWO the install included Vescom.\n\n![Close-up of a jet-black textured Muraspec wallcovering, Hilton London Metropole.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/metropole-01-800.webp)\n\nA close view of the jet-black embossed Muraspec installed at Hilton London Metropole. Texture is visible here; cleaning and fire requirements still depend on the exact product documents.Mr Wallcover project photograph, September 2019.[Hilton Metropole: the project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/)\n\nBefore you choose\n\n**Consider it when**\n: Cleaning and everyday wear are priorities worth discussing with the supplier.\n\n**The trade-off**\n: The material name alone does not establish wet-area or fire suitability.\n\n**Before ordering**\n: Check the particular product, cleaning method and project specification.\n\n01 · The finish\n\n## Joins\n\nSeams are still there. They are planned, not promised away.\n\n02 · The setting\n\n## Where it belongs\n\nBusy hotel rooms and corridors\n\n03 · Installation\n\n## Handling\n\nThe specified adhesive, the right substrate, and a sample in the room’s own light when the specification is still open.\n\n04 · Living with it\n\n## Care\n\nMore tolerant of cleaning than paper or silk, and still only as the maker allows. Vinyl on a wall is not, by itself, a fire certificate.\n\nDigital colour is a guide. Order a cutting or a sample before you commit to a room. We can install material you have already bought, or source a family and install it. Either way, the next step is a short note about the room.\n\nIllustrative material study · confirm the actual finish with a sample\n\nPause motion\n\nSave to shortlist\n\nSaved on this device only.\n\n[Discuss this material](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Acontract-vinyl) [I already have it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=install&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Acontract-vinyl)\n\n[How we install it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/hotel-wallcovering-installation/)\n\nInstallation experience\n\n## On the record\n\nAt [Raffles London at The OWO](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/raffles-london-the-owo/), a bespoke Vescom wallcovering made for the hotel went onto walls and parts of the joinery. At [Hyde London City](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/old-bailey-hotel/), Timorous Beasties' Tropical Clouded Leopard and Totem Damask went into the guest rooms as custom-printed vinyl. At [Hilton London Metropole](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/), a jet-black embossed Muraspec and Vescom on conference-room panels; at the [Mercedes-AMG showroom](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/mercedes-amg-showroom-london/), black matt Muraspec; at [DoubleTree by Hilton London – West End](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/doubletree-west-end/), Tektura wide vinyl in 2017.\n\nAt [Novotel London Canary Wharf](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/novotel-london-canary-wharf/), concrete-effect and timber-grain wallcoverings we installed in 2016 were photographed six years on, in 2022. The [hotel specification guide](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/hotel-wallcovering-specification/) covers cleaning, batches and documentation.\n\nPlan the detail\n\n## Useful reading\n\n- [Choosing wallcoverings](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/choosing-wallcoverings/)\n- [Hotel wallcoverings](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/hotel-wallcovering-specification/)\n\nFrom our portfolio\n\n## Selected work\n\n- [Raffles London at The OWO, Whitehall](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/raffles-london-the-owo/)\n- [Hyde London City (the Old Bailey Hotel)](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/old-bailey-hotel/)\n- [Hilton London Metropole](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/)\n- [Mercedes-AMG showroom, London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/mercedes-amg-showroom-london/)\n- [DoubleTree by Hilton London – West End](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/doubletree-west-end/)\n- [Novotel London Canary Wharf](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/novotel-london-canary-wharf/)\n- [Brown's Hotel, Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/browns-hotel-mayfair/)\n- [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/)\n\nMakers installed\n\n## Contract vinyl: makers we have hung\n\nEach in our own photograph of its product on the wall. A maker named here means Mr Wallcover installed that maker's product; it is not an approval, accreditation or endorsement.\n\n- ![Large conference room at the Hilton London Metropole with Vescom-covered wall panels.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/metropole-05-800.webp)\n\n### Vescom\n\nInstalled at [About](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/) · [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/) · [Hilton London Metropole](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/).\n\n- ![Black matt Muraspec walls around a door with a brushed stainless-steel trim, Mercedes-AMG showroom, London.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/mercedes-amg-02-800.webp)\n\n### Muraspec\n\nInstalled at [Everyman cinema, Liverpool](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/everyman-liverpool/) · [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/) · [Hilton London Metropole](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/) · [Mercedes-AMG showroom, London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/mercedes-amg-showroom-london/) · [Oxygen Freejumping, The O2](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/oxygen-freejumping-the-o2/).\n\n- ![Collage of a hotel bedroom and corridor finished in Tektura wide vinyl, DoubleTree by Hilton London West End, Holborn.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/doubletree-west-end-ig-01-800.webp)\n\n### Tektura\n\nInstalled at [About](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/) · [DoubleTree by Hilton London – West End](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/doubletree-west-end/) · [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/).\n\n- ![Timorous Beasties birds-and-bees wallpaper with colourful birds on blue-grey, a private project, Shoreditch.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/brand-timorous-beasties-01-800.webp)\n\n### Timorous Beasties\n\nInstalled at a private project, Shoreditch, 2019. [Our post](https://www.instagram.com/p/B5XtrKBlCHp/).\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
